msgstr "这条轨道的编码很多播放器解不了（AV1/HEVC/Opus），可能打不开"

msgid "Tick the box, paste your request headers (cookie/token) and try again."
msgstr "请勾选并粘贴请求头（含 cookie/token）后再试。"

msgid "Time cap reached (%ss): the page kept the browser busy and could not be read. The grab was stopped and the browser cleaned up. Raise --max-total to wait longer, or use a lighter page."
msgstr "已达时间上限（%s 秒）：这个页面一直占着浏览器、读不出来。已强制停止并清理浏览器进程。可以加大 --max-total 再等，或换更轻的页面。"

